                                                "sense_id": "5a77b082-b75e-3692-87b4-85645769ddf1",
                                                "text": "Formerly used only in Italy and Seattle, it includes such tongue activators as latte, lungo, cappuccino, ristretto, macchiato, mochaccino and Americano."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cf787492-10df-4996-a644-99f6ef29602b",
                                                "sense_id": "5a77b082-b75e-3692-87b4-85645769ddf1",
                                                "text": "With eight pre-set beverage buttons all your favorite hot drinks are just one push away: cappuccino, latte, one or two cups of ristretto, espresso, large cups of crema coffee, even hot chocolate and tea."
                                            }
                                        ]
